   "user": "Ματταθίας",
   "message": "I want to highlight the seeming contradiction that the people who are so against AI are largely from a population that tells us technological progress has coincided with moral triumphs and improvements in their world view, including the idea that we should be less discriminatory on the basis of biological closeness, even extending to more moral treatment of different species (shrimp welfare/veganism) but that they want to now halt technological progress explicitly because they think a new species will be birthed that will disrupt that moral progress",
   "timestamp": "2026-07-28T02:26:22.930000+00:00",
