   "user": "Ματταθίας",
   "message": "I think a lot of the anxiety about AI is about them genuinely not wanting to lose power, and it comes up when China is mentioned. Progressive/liberals actually fear losing power, they are obsessed with white privilege because actually highlighting it makes them feel good and important",
   "timestamp": "2026-07-28T02:28:55.598000+00:00",
   "channel": "kattt-log",
